cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "protstruct_review: a cross-tool quality-assessment harness for agent-refined and generated protein structures"
authors:
  - family-names: Joachimiak
    given-names: Marcin P.
    affiliation: Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory
repository-code: "https://github.com/realmarcin/protstruct_review"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
keywords:
  - protein structure
  - crystallographic refinement
  - cross-tool validation
  - negative-control benchmark
  - preregistration
abstract: >-
  Quality-assessment harness for agent-refined or generated protein structures.
  Independent oracles (PHENIX, CCP4, gemmi, biotite) are compared rather than
  trusted singly; tolerances are calibrated by preregistered benchmark rounds and
  a negative-control series of gold-standard sub-Ångström structures. Code is
  BSD-3-Clause; documentation, schema and authored records are CC-BY-4.0
  (LICENSE-DOCS.md); deposited wwPDB data retain upstream terms.
